{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Storyline:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, you play as a veteran detective who accidentally stumbles into a mysterious otherworldly dimension\u2014a terrifying realm hidden at the edge of reality. To survive, you must navigate this perilous world, from shadowy corridors to abandoned rooms, facing eerie chases and life-or-death battles against monstrous creatures. Each exploration will test your courage and wit. Only by completing missions in each realm can you gradually uncover the secrets of this dimension and find a way to escape. Upon finishing the final mission, you will face the ultimate choice: return to reality or be forever lost in this horrific realm.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>Trade &amp; Progression:</strong> Collect valuable items within a time limit, trade them at designated locations, and meet the required transaction quota to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609710/extras/\u52a8\u56fe\u62fe\u53d6\u6536\u96c6\u7269\u54c1_-big-original.gif?t=1746728333\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609710/extras/\u52a8\u56fe\u8d29\u5356\u6536\u96c6\u7269\u54c1_-big-original.gif?t=1746728333\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>Economy &amp; Upgrades:</strong> Earn more coins to purchase advanced weapons and stat boosts in the in-game store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609710/extras/\u52a8\u56fe\u5546\u57ce\u7cfb\u7edf_-big-original.gif?t=1746728333\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>Dynamic Levels:</strong> Each level features unique designs and 